@NODE Introduction "iNtRoDUCtiON"

                           . [ iNtRoDUCtiON: ] .
                            - --------------- -

There are always some dir packers out!! But nobody do it faster like
this door!! aT first i coded the door in pure ASM and included some
nice options!! (which i will explain later!)
Ive included lha, lzx, zip and none (merge it lha without compression)
Config it by yourself!!!!

I think its an important door for every BBS because it cost me a lots
of time to make a capture of dirs!!! so just use TurboLister!!!


All what you need is any Model of the great AMIGA, OS2.x or higher.

Thats all... have phun with this this little piece of heaven!

@{"  MAIN  " LINK MAIN}
@ENDNODE
@NODE Installation "iNStALLATiON!"

                           . [ INSTALLATION ] .
                            - -------------- -

Copy the files in the archive to your directories, they are:

LIBS:AEDoor.library ( © Sintax/WOT )  thx!!!

for /X v2.x or SiX:

add thiz line to ya cmds
BBS:Commands/BBS.Cmd

BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.XiM
BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.CFG
BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.GUIDE

for /X v3.x or higher:

BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/DD.info

BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.XiM
BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.CFG
BBS:Doors/TURBOLISTER/TURBOLISTER.GUIDE


@{"  MAIN  " LINK MAIN}
@ENDNODE
@NODE Configfile "cONFiGfiLE!"

                      . cONFiGfiLE fOr tURBO liStER! .
                       - --------------------------- -

TurboLister v0.2 by CøRteX/tRS¿!

[-----20 Chars-----]
#
yes                                   ;Real Confname for squeezed Filename
dARK_illUSiON                         ;Filename for squeezed dirs!!
LHA                                   ;1. Option
C:LHA -q a                            ;lha compression
.LHA                                  ;add thiz to the Filename
LZX                                   ;2. Option
C:LZX -q a                            ;lzx compression
.LZX                                  ;add this to the filename
ZIP                                   ;2. Option
C:ZIP -jkq                            ;zip compression
.ZIP                                  ;add thiz to the Filename
NONE                                  ;3. Option
C:LHA -zq a                           ;lha merge without any compression
.LHA                                  ;add thiz to the Filename
##


@{"  MAIN  " LINK MAIN}
